        "Open <a href=\"https://webostv.developer.lge.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">webostv.developer.lge.com</a> → <b>Sign In</b> → <b>Create Account</b>." to "<a href=\"https://webostv.developer.lge.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">webostv.developer.lge.com</a> खोलें → <b>Sign In</b> → <b>Create Account</b>।",
        "Enter an e-mail and password (free) – note them down." to "ई-मेल और पासवर्ड भरें (मुफ़्त) – इन्हें लिखकर रख लें।",
        "One LG account = Developer Mode on one TV." to "एक LG खाता = एक TV पर Developer Mode।",
