        "Press <b>Add ReCaption to Apps2Samsung</b> → confirm in Apps2Samsung." to "<b>ReCaption को Apps2Samsung में जोड़ें</b> दबाएँ → Apps2Samsung में पुष्टि करें।",
        "Install in Apps2Samsung" to "Apps2Samsung में इंस्टॉल करें",
        "In Apps2Samsung pick the TV → <b>Install</b> next to ReCaption." to "Apps2Samsung में TV चुनें → ReCaption के पास <b>Install</b>।",
        "The first time, sign in with a Samsung account (free)." to "पहली बार Samsung खाते से साइन इन करें (मुफ़्त)।",
        "Start ReCaption on the TV." to "TV पर ReCaption शुरू करें।",
        "New version: <b>Update</b> in Apps2Samsung." to "नया संस्करण: Apps2Samsung में <b>Update</b>।",
        "Choose <b>Xbox</b> → <b>Continue</b>." to "<b>Xbox</b> चुनें → <b>आगे बढ़ें</b>।",
        "Choose <b>PlayStation 5</b> → <b>Continue</b>." to "<b>PlayStation 5</b> चुनें → <b>आगे बढ़ें</b>।",
        "🔵 Account for ReCaption" to "🔵 ReCaption के लिए खाता",
        "ReCaption needs its own 🔵 account. You keep playing on your 🟢 account." to "ReCaption को अपना अलग 🔵 खाता चाहिए। खेलना अपने 🟢 खाते पर ही जारी रहता है।",
        "<a class=\"stahnout\" href=\"https://www.playstation.com/en-gb/support/account/create-account-for-psn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Create a PlayStation account</a>" to "<a class=\"stahnout\" href=\"https://www.playstation.com/en-gb/support/account/create-account-for-psn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PlayStation खाता बनाएँ</a>",
        "A different e-mail than the 🟢 gaming account → confirm it in the e-mail." to "🟢 गेमिंग खाते से अलग ई-मेल → ई-मेल में जाकर पुष्टि करें।",
        "An adult's date of birth." to "किसी वयस्क की जन्मतिथि।",
        "No PlayStation Plus needed." to "PlayStation Plus की ज़रूरत नहीं।",
        "🔵 User on the PS5" to "🔵 PS5 पर उपयोगकर्ता",
        "On the PS5, the <b>profile icon</b> at the top right → <b>Switch User</b>." to "PS5 पर ऊपर दाईं ओर <b>प्रोफ़ाइल आइकन</b> → <b>Switch User</b>।",
        "<b>Add User</b> → <b>Add User to This PS5</b> → <b>Get Started</b>." to "<b>Add User</b> → <b>Add User to This PS5</b> → <b>Get Started</b>।",
        "Sign in with the 🔵 account (QR code or e-mail)." to "🔵 खाते से साइन इन करें (QR कोड या ई-मेल से)।",
        "Remember the 🔵 user's name." to "🔵 उपयोगकर्ता का नाम याद रखें।",
        "Remote Play on the PS5" to "PS5 पर Remote Play",
        "On the PS5 switch to the <b>🔵 user</b>." to "PS5 पर <b>🔵 उपयोगकर्ता</b> पर स्विच करें।",
        "Settings → System → Remote Play → turn on <b>Enable Remote Play</b>." to "Settings → System → Remote Play → <b>Enable Remote Play</b> चालू करें।",
        "In the same place turn on <b>Hide Remote Play Connection Status Pop-Up</b> – for both the 🔵 and the 🟢 user." to "वहीं <b>Hide Remote Play Connection Status Pop-Up</b> चालू करें – 🔵 और 🟢 दोनों उपयोगकर्ताओं के लिए।",
        "Don't use <b>Pair Device</b> yet – that's in the Connecting step." to "<b>Pair Device</b> अभी नहीं – वह कनेक्शन वाले चरण में है।",
        "Xbox and Microsoft account" to "Xbox और Microsoft खाता",
        "🎮 Xbox + 📱 phone" to "🎮 Xbox + 📱 फ़ोन",
        "On the Xbox: Settings → Devices & connections → Remote features → turn on <b>Enable remote features</b>." to "Xbox पर: Settings → Devices & connections → Remote features → <b>Enable remote features</b> चालू करें।",
        "Settings → General → Power mode → <b>Sleep</b>." to "Settings → General → Power mode → <b>Sleep</b>।",
        "In ReCaption press <b>Sign in with a Microsoft account</b> – a code appears." to "ReCaption में <b>Microsoft खाते से साइन इन करें</b> दबाएँ – एक कोड दिखेगा।",
        "On a phone or computer open <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">microsoft.com/link</a> → enter the code → sign in with the account you play with." to "फ़ोन या कंप्यूटर पर <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">microsoft.com/link</a> खोलें → कोड डालें → उस खाते से साइन इन करें जिससे खेला जाता है।",
        "Pick your Xbox." to "अपना Xbox चुनें।",
        "Translation" to "अनुवाद",
        "Press <b>Download</b> (the language pack, only once)." to "<b>डाउनलोड</b> दबाएँ (भाषा पैक, केवल एक बार)।",
